alker_s1, exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8, exp_008d_subsample_on_h8 |\\\\n| D062 | 2026-05-16 | C2 因果链精化：CIVO trigger 是 trained + exposed 组合，非 tra | exp_008a, exp_008d, exp_015b, exp_008f, exp_006, exp_007 |\\\\n| D061 | 2026-05-15 | D061: 016e reward SGS 是 no-op（reward→dt_emb 梯度=0）。 | 016e, 018 |\\\\n| D060 | 2026-05-15 | D060: cuda:1→Cheetah baseline(010a), cuda:0(009d后) | 010a, 018 |\\\\n| D059 | 2026-05-15 | D059: Framing 选 B（diagnostic + SGS negative），cuda: | 016e, 010a |\\\\n| D058 | 2026-05-15 | D058: 016e SGS 失败不影响论文核心 framing——加入为 C2 机制深化证据（re | 016e, 008d, 008f |\\\\n| D057 | 2026-05-15 | 016e SGS 崩溃（v/e=658%）：Stop-Gradient 未阻断 CIVO，证明根因是 | 016e, 008d, 008f |\\\\n| D056 | 2026-05-15 | 016c 根因确认为 SummaryWriter.add_video deadlock（moviep | 016c, 009h |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4063, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011dKVxmFYtWNYPzq1ZWHJyY","session_id":"670b194d-bd1a-4414-88fd-4c7f9eb01a25","uuid":"4ccf1020-ea2a-4f54-80f9-b2eb77df8cf5","timestamp":"2026-05-16T14:15:51.238Z"}
